      "title": {
        "en": "Co to jest?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "In the mountains, *w górach*, you walk a *szlak* (a trail) to a *szczyt* (a peak) past a *skała* (a rock), and sleep in a *schronisko*, a mountain hut. By the sea there is a *wyspa*, an island. A *las* is a forest. An old town has *mury*, walls, and a *brama*, a gate."
      }
    }
